<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Build simple furniture like simple beds, basic tables, stools, benches and more.-->
  <MF_BasicFurniture.description>解锁建造简单的家具，诸如简单的床、桌子、凳子、长椅等等。</MF_BasicFurniture.description>
  <MF_BasicFurniture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->foundations of comfort-->
    <li>subject-&gt;舒适基础</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->rediscovered ancient techniques for crafting durable, essential furniture-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重新找到了用于制作坚固的基础家具的远古技术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the use of local materials to create comfortable living spaces-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创了通过就地取材来打造舒适居所的先例</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->taught the community the value of crafting with nature, not against it-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;教导了整个社群利用自然进行创造的价值，而不是一味地抗拒它</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->initiated the tradition of communal gatherings around the hearth and table-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创立了一同聚在火炉和桌子前谈天说地的传统</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->establishing the basics of homely comfort and utility-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;打下温馨舒适和实用的基础</li>
  </MF_BasicFurniture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: basic furniture-->
  <MF_BasicFurniture.label>基础家具</MF_BasicFurniture.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build furniture of the modern day that is focused on practicality over beauty, such as roulette tables, wardrobes, dart boards, punching bags and ergonomic beds.-->
  <MF_ModernFurniture.description>解锁建造实用性强于美观性的现代家具，如轮盘赌桌、衣柜、飞镖板、沙袋和符合人体工学的床。</MF_ModernFurniture.description>
  <MF_ModernFurniture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->practical elegance-->
    <li>subject-&gt;典雅实用</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->embraced the fusion of form and function to suit modern lifestyles-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为适应现代生活方式而接纳外观与功能兼备</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated with new materials for durability and comfort-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用了耐用与舒适兼备的新材料进行创新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->prioritized ergonomic designs to enhance daily living-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为改善日常生活而优先采用了符合人体工程学的设计</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced concepts of modular and space-saving furniture-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为家具引入了模块化和节约空间的概念</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->championed the minimalist aesthetic, focusing on simplicity and practicality-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;支持注重简约与实用的极简主义美学</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->redefining living spaces for the contemporary era-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;重新定义这个时代的居所</li>
  </MF_ModernFurniture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: modern furniture-->
  <MF_ModernFurniture.label>现代家具</MF_ModernFurniture.label>
  <!--EN: Build luxury furniture focused strongly on aesthetics and beauty over practicality, usually only seen in the houses of the wealthy elite. Including poster beds, royal chairs, tables and armchairs.-->
  <MF_RoyalFurniture.description>解锁建造美观性强于实用性的豪华家具，通常只在富有精英阶层的房子里看到。包括四柱床、豪华椅、桌子和扶手椅。</MF_RoyalFurniture.description>
  <MF_RoyalFurniture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the art of luxury-->
    <li>subject-&gt;豪华艺术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->reclaimed forgotten methods of inlay and marquetry for exquisite pieces-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;取回被忘却已久的精美家具镶嵌细工技术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->fostered a new age of craftsmanship, blending beauty with utility-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;助长了美观与实用兼备的新技艺时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->commissioned pieces that would become the envy of visiting dignitaries-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;委托制作的家具将会使众多来访的达官显贵羡煞不已</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->inspired artisans to push the boundaries of design and materials-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;启发了手艺人们推动设计与材料的进步</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created spaces of unparalleled elegance, reflecting the pinnacle of culture-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创造了极度优雅的空间，反映了文化的巅峰</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->crafting symbols of status and artistry-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;打造地位与艺术的象征</li>
  </MF_RoyalFurniture.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: artisan furniture-->
  <MF_RoyalFurniture.label>豪华家具</MF_RoyalFurniture.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build small and large bins, objects that slowly clean the environment they are in.-->
  <MF_WasteDisposal.description>解锁建造各种尺寸的垃圾箱，它们会慢慢清洁它们周围的环境。</MF_WasteDisposal.description>
  <MF_WasteDisposal.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the cleanliness revolution-->
    <li>subject-&gt;清洁革新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed efficient waste management solutions to promote hygiene-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;研发了改善卫生环境的高效垃圾管理方式</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced the concept of recycling, transforming waste into resources-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;通过引入回收处理的概念，将垃圾变废为宝</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered bins that integrate seamlessly into both public and private spaces-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计了可以无缝集成至公共与私人场所的垃圾箱</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered waste processing techniques that minimize environmental impact-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创了垃圾处理的新技术，能最大程度地降低对环境的影响</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->catalyzed a cultural shift towards sustainability and cleanliness-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;促进了文化向注重可持续性和清洁性方面发展</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->enhancing communities with smart waste solutions-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;采用智能垃圾处理方案改善社群</li>
  </MF_WasteDisposal.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: waste disposal-->
  <MF_WasteDisposal.label>废物处理</MF_WasteDisposal.label>
</LanguageData>
